--- META ---
name: Any with well-known @type
summary: Verify well-known types still resolve inside google.protobuf.Any once a custom type resolver is installed
tags: [wkt, any]

--- ENDPOINT ---
wkt.AnyResponseService/GetWrapped

--- REQUEST ---
{
  "name": "well-known"
}

--- RESPONSE ---
{
  "done": true,
  "name": "well-known",
  "result": {
    "@type": "type.googleapis.com/google.protobuf.StringValue",
    "value": "hello-wkt"
  }
}
